	<!-- Google AdMob application id. This is Google's official TEST app id
	     (shows test ads, safe while developing). Replace with your real AdMob
	     iOS app id (ca-app-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX~YYYYYYYYYY) before release. -->
